Subject: [PATCH 02625/11362] [conductor] In-process docs for PHASE A1
 (HEADLINE; oracle-distinct LOCALIZER, DECONFOUNDED; verifier_is_oracle=false)
 -- REAL INTERVENTION first-error data + a contrastive earliest-error
 localizer with the deconfounding controls BUILT IN (arXiv:2601.14209 'InT
 self-proposed interventions for first-error credit assignment', the .406
 SOTA-ingestion flagged_for_v407). .406 (exp4392) trained a localizer on
 SYNTHETIC template-injected first-error data and reported a 'win' (FoVer F1
 1.0 vs the 0.096 ensemble baseline), but exp4393's skeptic-proof QUARANTINED
 it as PURE POSITION BIAS: beats_position_only_baseline=false,
 template_ablation_drop=0.0 (the localizer learned nothing real -- the F1=1.0
 is the IMPLAUSIBLE_PERFECT tell). ROOT CAUSE: synthetic template-injected
 data does not carry the REAL first-error distribution. THE FIX
 (arXiv:2601.14209): use REAL verifier-checked intervention first-error labels
 -- (1) take REAL failed reasoning traces (the cached FoVer step-labeled
 corpus + the GAP-4 ARC pool), (2) for each, identify via a single-step
 INTERVENTION (replace step k with a verifier-checked correct step, recompute
 the suffix) the EARLIEST step whose correction redirects the trajectory to
 success = the ground-truth first-error index, (3) STRATIFY the resulting
 labels by first-error POSITION and template/problem FAMILY, (4) train a
 CONTRASTIVE earliest-error localizer, (5) evaluate on a HELD-OUT-FAMILY REAL
 split with the deconfounding controls BUILT INTO THE HEADLINE (a
 content-blind POSITION-ONLY baseline from the empirical first-error-step
 distribution + a TEMPLATE-FAMILY HOLDOUT: train on some families, test on
 held-out families). Emit localizer_genuinely_beats_position_only BARE bool :=
 (the real-intervention localizer's held-out-family first-error F1 EXCEEDS the
 content-blind position-only baseline, delta CI95-excl-0, AND degrades
 materially under template-family holdout -- i.e. it depends on CONTENT, not
 just position). verifier_is_oracle=false (a learned localizer; the
 executable/reference prefix-check defines correctness, the localizer
 estimates WHICH step). A win = the oracle-distinct localizer GENUINELY
 localizes (the controls .406 FAILED now pass); a clean null (it still ties
 position-only) RETIRES the localizer-as-headline + logs a sharper
 missing-verifier gap. Cached + CPU; the intervention check is
 symbolic/reference, no live training. NO TRM training; interventions are
 OFFLINE labels ONLY (no generator SFT/RL).

